// `std.rand`: the home of randomness' host interface, `std.rand.Eff`, whose
// operation draws fair bits from the entropy source of the operating system.
// A source names the interface where it imports this module,
// `import std.rand;`, and nowhere else. The interface is native, so no
// declaration here states it. The randomness capability, distributions and
// seeded generators wait for demand.
//
// - see: #5707
